                <note rend="inline" type="source">837.00/3721: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Nassau</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Hurley</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nassau</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-08-27T15:00:00-05:00">August 27, 1933—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 4:50 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Machado and party left by the steamship <hi rendition="#italic">Lady Rodney</hi>
                    last night, destination Montreal via Bermuda.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hurley</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
